main.pdf

# PDFs are not tracked. The literature/ scans are third-party and were removed
# from this repository's history on 2026-09-02; main.pdf and the picture PDFs
# are build artefacts that latexmk regenerates, and tracking main.pdf alone had
# put 40 MB of superseded revisions into the history. Publish the book through
# a Release or the web edition rather than through git.
# To track one anyway, in full knowledge of the above: git add -f <file>
*.pdf
# ...except the figures.  transducer-book-pics.pdf is not a build artefact: it
# is the source of every picture in the book, included page by page from
# macros.sty (\includegraphics[page=#1]{transducer-book-pics}).  Removing it
# from the repository breaks the compilation of the whole book.
!transducer-book-pics.pdf
